<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<TestCaseEntity>
   <description>Confirmed live 9/18/2026: the new UI enforces the PO Box rule ("P.O. Box addresses are not allowed") the same as the old UI. BUT it has no max-length enforcement (maxLength attribute is -1, unset) and no disallowed-character validation at all (aria-invalid stays "false" for "123 Main St!") — both of which the old UI enforces. Only the PO Box check is automated here since it's the only rule that actually exists to test. See TC_Registration_AddressFormat_OldUI for the full old UI comparison.</description>
   <name>TC_Registration_AddressFormat</name>
